and complain about these things.

00:50:40.404 --> 00:50:43.607
Look at this country, this
is such a fabulous country.

00:50:44.608 --> 00:50:47.010
It's such a diverse country.

00:50:48.211 --> 00:50:50.847
You know I've talked
to so many people,

00:50:50.847 --> 00:50:52.149
I've interviewed so many people

00:50:53.650 --> 00:50:56.753
and Shelby Steele in particular,

00:50:56.753 --> 00:51:00.023 align:start size:97% position:3%
something he said to me just
rings every day so true.

00:51:01.358 --> 00:51:03.026
You're free.

00:51:03.026 --> 00:51:04.327
You are free.

00:51:05.762 --> 00:51:07.864
Do whatever you wanna
do with your life,

00:51:07.864 --> 00:51:10.200
nobody's stopping you except you

00:51:11.401 --> 00:51:12.869
and you don't know what
to do with your freedom.

00:51:13.837 --> 00:51:14.704
You're free.

00:51:16.206 --> 00:51:18.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now in how many countries
can you say that?

00:51:18.008 --> 00:51:18.942
Very few.

00:51:20.977 --> 00:51:22.512
And when you look at how
we send our men and women

00:51:22.512 --> 00:51:25.549
off to war to defend people
who look differently than us,

00:51:25.549 --> 00:51:27.751
who have different
religions than us.

00:51:27.751 --> 00:51:32.622
In some hellhole somewhere,
for whatever the reason is

00:51:32.622 --> 00:51:36.793 align:start size:97% position:3%
and then you call Americans
systemically racist?

00:51:38.328 --> 00:51:43.233
This is blasphemy,
this is appalling.

00:51:43.233 --> 00:51:44.668
When you look at this country

00:51:46.136 --> 00:51:47.270 align:start size:97% position:3%
where we have the highest
rate of interracial marriage

00:51:47.270 --> 00:51:50.574
in our history, over 20%.

00:51:50.574 --> 00:51:54.077 align:start size:97% position:3%
When you look at the diversity
in our police forces,

00:51:54.077 --> 00:51:55.545
the diversity in our military,

00:51:55.545 --> 00:51:57.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
the diversity in our
public figures and acting

00:51:57.781 --> 00:51:59.149
and so forth and so on.

00:52:00.617 --> 00:52:04.287
When you look at millionaires
and billionaires of all colors

00:52:04.287 --> 00:52:08.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
the idea that this country
is systemically racist,

00:52:08.825 --> 00:52:11.294
we embrace a capitalist system.

00:52:11.294 --> 00:52:13.597
The capitalist system
is incapable of racism.

00:52:13.597 --> 00:52:16.099 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's literally
incapable of racism.

00:52:16.099 --> 00:52:18.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
I give this example,
let's say I go to a diner.

00:52:20.337 --> 00:52:23.340
Let's say somebody else goes
to a diner and they're a bigot.

00:52:24.808 --> 00:52:27.511
And they get eggs and bacon
and milk and whatever it is.

00:52:28.712 --> 00:52:33.116
They don't know who, who
owned that chicken farm.

00:52:33.116 --> 00:52:34.784
Could've been a Black family.

00:52:34.784 --> 00:52:37.921 align:start position:0%
They don't know where that bacon
came from, they don't know.

00:52:37.921 --> 00:52:42.292
So he may be a bigot but
capitalism is not bigoted

00:52:43.393 --> 00:52:46.563 align:start size:88% position:13%
and capitalism and
liberty go hand in hand.

00:52:46.563 --> 00:52:48.532 align:start size:97% position:3%
It doesn't mean you can't
have capitalism and tyranny.

00:52:48.532 --> 00:52:50.000
Like you have quasi-capitalism

00:52:50.000 --> 00:52:51.968
and heavy handed
tyranny in China.

00:52:51.968 --> 00:52:54.838 align:start size:88% position:13%
But for liberty, you
have to have capitalism.

00:52:56.039 --> 00:52:58.141 align:start size:88% position:13%
This is very, very
important to understand.

00:52:58.141 --> 00:53:00.076
So when there's an
attack on capitalism

00:53:00.076 --> 00:53:02.245
it's really an attack on
private property rights,

00:53:02.245 --> 00:53:05.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
liberty, your intellectual
and physical labor.

00:53:05.482 --> 00:53:07.250
It is an attack on you.

00:53:09.052 --> 00:53:12.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I look at this country
and I say to myself,

00:53:12.756 --> 00:53:14.491
"These people who keep
calling it systemically."

00:53:14.491 --> 00:53:16.793
There's really two kind
of people who do this.

00:53:18.762 --> 00:53:22.832 align:start size:97% position:3%
It is the, the self anointed
or self proclaimed elite

00:53:24.167 --> 00:53:29.072 align:start position:0%
or it's the, or it's the
Marxist ideologue in the street.

00:53:31.942 --> 00:53:33.910
The vast majority of
people in this country,

00:53:33.910 --> 00:53:37.214 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't care if they're Black
or brown or they're what.

00:53:37.214 --> 00:53:39.049
They're not pining for Marxism.

00:53:39.049 --> 00:53:39.883 align:start size:84% position:16%
- No.
- They're not pining

00:53:39.883 --> 00:53:41.818
to eliminate the cops.

00:53:41.818 --> 00:53:44.020 align:start size:88% position:13%
They don't hate the
United States military.

00:53:45.121 --> 00:53:48.058
So that is a positive.

00:53:48.058 --> 00:53:49.392
Just think that most of the
people, we can get to them,

00:53:49.392 --> 00:53:51.194
we can explain things to them.

00:53:51.194 --> 00:53:53.430
I think most of them
will still be with us.

00:53:53.430 --> 00:53:55.665
- I think that was
Mark Levin's opus.

00:53:57.067 --> 00:53:58.568
You took us out beautifully.

00:53:58.568 --> 00:54:00.070
I'm gonna ask you
to stick around,

00:54:00.070 --> 00:54:02.906
so we're gonna do one thing
for my Locals exclusive.

00:54:02.906 --> 00:54:06.176
I'm gonna ask you what
Mark Levin does for fun.

00:54:06.176 --> 00:54:09.179 align:start position:0%
So I'm gonna let you think
about that for about 10 seconds.

00:54:09.179 --> 00:54:10.647
I'm gonna thank ya
for doing the show.

00:54:10.647 --> 00:54:11.848
We're gonna link to all your,

00:54:11.848 --> 00:54:13.516
everyone knows where
you are and who you are

00:54:13.516 --> 00:54:14.751
and all that good stuff

00:54:14.751 --> 00:54:15.719 align:start size:84% position:16%
but we're gonna link
to all that below

00:54:15.719 --> 00:54:16.886
and I just wanna tell ya,

00:54:16.886 --> 00:54:18.722 align:start size:84% position:16%
it's really an
honor and a pleasure

00:54:18.722 --> 00:54:22.425
and I hope we can this in
person one of these days.

00:54:22.425 --> 00:54:25.061
- That would be great and the
honor and pleasure is mine.

00:54:25.061 --> 00:54:27.397
You were absolutely
terrific, thank you.

00:54:27.397 --> 00:54:28.632
- Thank you.

